## Security Rule Controls

### Access Controls (§164.312(a)(1))

| Requirement | MedSync Implementation |
|-------------|------------------------|
| Unique User Identification | Email-based unique IDs |
| Emergency Access | Break-glass procedures |
| Automatic Logoff | 15-minute timeout |
| Encryption & Decryption | AES-256 at rest |

### Audit Controls (§164.312(b))

| Capability | Details |
|------------|---------|
| Events Logged | All PHI access, modifications |
| Log Retention | 7 years |
| Log Protection | Immutable, encrypted |
| Review Frequency | Weekly automated + monthly manual |

### Integrity Controls (§164.312(c)(1))

| Capability | Details |
|------------|---------|
| Data Validation | Input validation, checksums |
| Change Detection | Hash verification |
| Error Correction | Automated + manual processes |

### Transmission Security (§164.312(e)(1))

| Capability | Details |
|------------|---------|
| Encryption | TLS 1.3 (minimum 1.2) |
| Integrity Controls | HMAC validation |
| Network Controls | VPN, segmentation |

