## Breach Notification Compliance

### Breach Assessment Process

| Step | Action | Timeline |
|------|--------|----------|
| 1 | Incident identification | Immediate |
| 2 | Initial assessment | < 24 hours |
| 3 | Breach determination | < 48 hours |
| 4 | Risk assessment (4 factors) | < 72 hours |
| 5 | Notification decision | Per assessment |
| 6 | Covered Entity notification | Per BAA (24-72 hours) |

### Breach Statistics

| Year | Incidents Investigated | Breaches Determined | Individuals Affected |
|------|------------------------|---------------------|---------------------|
| 2022 | 8 | 0 | 0 |
| 2023 | 12 | 1 | 0 (discovered pre-exposure) |
| 2024 | 15 | 0 | 0 |

### Four-Factor Risk Assessment

| Factor | Assessment Criteria |
|--------|---------------------|
| Nature & Extent of PHI | Data elements involved |
| Unauthorized Person | Who accessed/received |
| PHI Actually Acquired/Viewed | Evidence of access |
| Mitigation | Steps taken to reduce risk |

